{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Lh8XmZLAjj1793198966.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>加拿大逾三年以來首次加息0.25厘。</p><p></p><p>加拿大央行宣布，指標利率上調至2.5厘，符合市場預期，是2023年7月以來首次加息。</p><p></p><p>加拿大央行議息聲明指，期望通過加息以降低能源價格上升，廣泛傳導至其他商品和服務價格的風險。央行又指，可能會進一步提高政策利率，但市場仍存在不確定性，央行委員同意要審慎行事。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:14.511586+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:58:19.230176+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:55:39.314002+00:00","content_hash":"b1fa1607df3f6874f3e6bcd405295f1cecff2227123c5e67c236fa2a66826c9a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:14.511586+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}